|YK0================================================================
                              |GKBMONK CHALLENGES
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Accept the challenges so that you can feel the exhilaration of
victory.'|WKO - |RKBMaster Garg Patun|WKO

|YKOAs an aspiring Monk progresses through the ranks they will face
many challenges determined to test their skills, ability,
endurance and patience. A Monk will be required to advance
through a combat trial to advance through the ranks of the
guild. [See |GKBRanks|YK0 for more info]  If the trial is passed 
the Monk will progress to the next rank within the guild.
Once the rank has been achieved by passing the trial the Monk
may advance to the next guild level. Monks must seek out the
appropriate training master and challenge for the right to
progress in the order. At any time a Monk may choose to
|GKBescape|YK0 the challenge. If they have not defeated their opponent
at this time a severe penalty shall be applied. Challenges
|YK0should be prepared for carefully as they can result in much
|YK0pain for those who fail.

|YKO================================================================
